<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in past week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in past week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to July 18.</p>
<p>    Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>						 Percent</p>
<p>Rank Name			 Price     change</p>
<p> 1  Centaur Min&amp;Expl	   1.64	31.20</p>
<p> 2  Great Central		2.69	19.03</p>
<p> 3  North Limited		5.20	11.35</p>
<p> 4  Coca-Cola Am		16.58	10.53</p>
<p> 5  Newcrest Mining	    2.70	 8.00</p>
<p> 6  Goodman Fielder	    1.92	 7.87</p>
<p> 7  Santos			 6.40	 6.67</p>
<p> 8  Argo Inv		     3.28	 5.81</p>
<p> 9  Westfield Amer-N	   1.21	 4.31</p>
<p>10  Comalco			6.90	 4.07</p>
<p>    Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>						 Percent</p>
<p>Rank Name			 Price     change</p>
<p> 1  Goldfields		   1.25     -26.47</p>
<p> 2  Boral			  3.97	-9.32</p>
<p> 3  CSR			    4.96	-5.98</p>
<p> 4  Jupiters Ltd		 3.25	-5.80</p>
<p> 5  David Jones		  1.90	-5.47</p>
<p> 6  Qantas			 2.97	-4.81</p>
<p> 7  Caltex Aust		  4.30	-4.44</p>
<p> 8  Fletcher NZ Fst	    1.75	-4.37</p>
<p> 9  Transurban Group	1070.00	-4.04</p>
<p>10  RGC			    4.19	-3.90</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
